gine/godot/issues/comments/6034548589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6034548589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6034548589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ6_nbQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T08:58:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:02:56Z","body":"Some history there:\r\n- #28448\r\n- #50737 \r\n\r\nThe latter was meant to do what this PR does for `PIE`, by removing the flags - assuming those are enabled by default on modern GCC and Clang at the time. Did this change?\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Seems like PIE being enabled by default is something that's configured when compiling the compiler. Most distros enabled it, which is likely why @Calinou found that removing the `-fno-pie` was enough. But evidently our Linux SDK doesn't enable it as current builds don't have PIE enabled. So yes, being explicit is better.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6034548589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6034657219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6034657219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6034657219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ7GPww","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:04:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:04:28Z","body":"> assuming those are enabled by default on modern GCC and Clang at the time. Did this change?\r\n\r\nIn most cases it should, but it seems to be distro specific. Official build executables seems to be non PIE.\r\n\r\n```\r\n% bincheck ./Godot_v4.8-dev7_linux.x86_64\r\nFile: ./Godot_v4.8-dev7_linux.x86_64 (ELF)\r\n┌──────────────────┬───────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n│ Property         ┆ Status        ┆ Details                                      │\r\n╞══════════════════╪═══════════════╪══════════════════════════════════════════════╡\r\n│ RELRO            ┆ WARN ┆ Partial                                      │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Stack Canary     ┆ FAIL ┆                                              │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ NX               ┆ PASS ┆ Stack not executable                         │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ PIE              ┆ FAIL ┆ ET_EXEC                                      │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Linkage          ┆ INFO ┆ dynamic                                      │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Fortify Source   ┆ PASS ┆ __read_chk, __sprintf_chk                    │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ RPATH            ┆ PASS ┆ Not set                                      │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ RUNPATH          ┆ PASS ┆ Not set                                      │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Debug Info       ┆ PASS ┆ No debug info                                │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Symbol Table     ┆ PASS ┆ Stripped                                     │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ libc Flavor      ┆ INFO ┆ glibc                                        │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ Banned Functions ┆ FAIL ┆ HIGH: strcpy, strcat, sprintf, system, popen │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ File Mode        ┆ PASS ┆ no SUID/SGID                                 │\r\n└──────────────────┴───────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6034657219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6034784194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6034784194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6034784194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ7N_wg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:12:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:12:01Z","body":"> > PIE has a performance cost on 32-bit. Needs perf measuring before enabling it.\r\n> \r\n> Is 32-bit Linux still a relevant platform? Looking at last two stable releases download stats it seems to be under 1%:\r\n\r\nIt's hard to say just from this data. Download counts for the *editor* don't necessarily correlate with how often developers will choose to export Linux x86_32 builds.\r\n\r\nIt's still a supported platform on Steam and there's no setting to make it clear in the backend that a Linux build is x86_64 only, unlike there is for Windows:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"387\" height=\"411\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/012029fd-5571-4be8-aab2-c85375dd0acf\" />\r\n\r\nSo that may mean users on Steam 32-bit may purchase a game that advertises Linux support, and end up getting a binary that doesn't work on their system, leading to refunds or negative reviews. Even if it's just 1%, that's not insignificant for studios when Overwhelmingly Positive requires 95% positive rating.\r\n\r\nI'll do a quick performance check for enabling `PIE` on x86_32.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6034784194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035034358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6035034358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6035034358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ7dQ9g","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:26:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:48:37Z","body":"Looking at [top 20 Godot releases](https://steamdb.info/tech/Engine/Godot/?os=linux&sort=rating_desc) with Linux support on steamdb, none have 32-bit binaries included. I'm not suggesting dropping in entirely, but hardening probably won't do much for these, since 32-bit systems are likely outdated and not secure on their own.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035034358/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035481649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6035481649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6035481649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ74kMQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:54:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:54:34Z","body":"> I'll do a quick performance check for enabling `PIE` on x86_32.\r\n\r\nRan some CPU-bound microbenchmark and measure around 10% performance decrease for x86_32, so the exclusion currently in this PR makes sense. The PR as is only enabling `RELRO`/`BIND_NOW` on x86_32 runs the same benchmark within noise compared to `master`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035481649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035496766","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6035496766","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6035496766,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ75fPg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:55:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:55:33Z","body":"Are these flags only relevant for Linux? What about mingw-gcc for Windows and all the Clang-based platforms?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035496766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035611039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6035611039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6035611039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ8Adnw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T10:02:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T10:06:04Z","body":"> Are these flags only relevant for Linux? What about mingw-gcc for Windows and all the Clang-based platforms?\r\n\r\nRELRO is ELF specific.\r\n\r\nWindows binaries already have ASLR enabled. And macOS binaries are already PIE. But it might be worth adding explicit flags since it's depends on default compiler config.\r\n\r\nShould be the same PIE flag for macOS. And something like `-Wl,--dynamicbase,--high-entropy-va` for MinGW.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035611039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6035962532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233#issuecomment-6035962532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","id":6035962532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ8V6pA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T10:24:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10